 Consider two circles centered at $(4,0)$ and $(-4,0)$, each with radius 1. [asy]
draw(circle((4,0),1),red); dot((4,0));
draw(circle((-4,0),1),red); dot((-4,0));
dot((0,.5));
draw((0,.5)--(0,5),dashed);
