After simplifying the exponent under the square root, we have:
\begin{align*}
&\sqrt{2^{((2^{(2^{(2^1)})})} \\
&= 2^{((2^{2^{(2^1)})})} \\
\end{align*}
Thus, the final answer is $\boxed{2^{((2^{2^{(2^1)})})}}.$

